  "actions": [
    {
      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "1",
      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> three times per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The Leng spider spins a web within 20 feet of itself to create a Grasping Snare, Stunning Snare, or Warning Snare. The Leng spider's web provides all the raw materials it needs. All save and Escape DCs associated with web traps use the Leng spider's Crafting DC for traps (DC 36). A web trap decays after 24 hours.</p>",
      "frequency": {
        "max": 3,
        "per": "day"
      },
      "name": "Lay Web Trap",
      "requirements": null,
      "traits": [
        "manipulate"
      ],
      "trigger": null
    },
    {
      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "1",
      "description": "<p>The Leng spider creates a weapon by applying a cord of webbing to heavy objects, such as rocks or chunks of metal, either attaching two heavy objects together to create a web bola or fastening one to its leg to create a web war flail.</p>",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "Create Web Weaponry",
      "requirements": null,
      "traits": [
        "manipulate"
      ],
      "trigger": null
    },
    {
      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "1",
      "description": "<p>The Leng spider moves straight down up to 120 feet, suspended by a web line. It can hang from the web or drop off. The distance it Descends on a Web doesn't count when calculating falling damage.</p>\n<p>The web can be severed by a Strike that deals slashing damage (AC 30, Hardness 15, 25 HP), causing the Leng spider to fall.</p>",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "Descend on a Web",
      "requirements": null,
      "traits": [
        "move"
      ],
      "trigger": null
    },
    {
      "category": "defensive",
      "cost": "passive",
      "description": "",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "+1 Status to All Saves vs. Magic",
      "requirements": null,
      "traits": [],
      "trigger": null
    },
    {
      "category": "interaction",
      "cost": "passive",
      "description": "<p><p>A constant spell affects the monster without the monster needing to cast it, and its duration is unlimited. If a constant spell gets counteracted, the monster can reactivate it by spending the normal spellcasting actions the spell requires.</p></p>",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "Constant Spells",
      "requirements": null,
      "traits": [],
      "trigger": null
    },
    {
      "category": "defensive",
      "cost": "passive",
      "description": "<p><p>A monster with this ability regains the given number of Hit Points each round at the beginning of its turn.</p></p>",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "Fast Healing 10",
      "requirements": null,
      "traits": [],
      "trigger": null
    },
    {
      "category": "interaction",
      "cost": "passive",
      "description": "<p>While touching its webs, the Leng spider has precise Tremorsense to detect the vibrations of creatures touching its web.</p>",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "Greater Web Sense",
      "requirements": null,
      "traits": [],
      "trigger": null
    },
    {
      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "passive",
      "description": "<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:33]</p>\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[2d6[poison]] damage and Drained 1 (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[2d6[poison]] damage, Confused, and Drained 2 (1 round); the confused effect has the emotion and mental traits.</p>",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "Leng Spider Venom",
      "requirements": null,
      "traits": [
        "emotion",
        "mental",
        "poison"
      ],
      "trigger": null
    },
    {
      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "passive",
      "description": "<p>A Leng spider can use a web bola to Trip a target with the Athletics skill. The skill check takes a -2 circumstance penalty. A web bola deals no damage when used to Trip.</p>",
